      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعطى</span></b>  <i>He asked for a gift;</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعطّى</span></b> . (S, K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعطى النَّاسَ بِكَفِّهِ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى كَفِّهِ</span> <i>He sought, demanded,</i> or <i>asked,</i> [<i>a gift</i>]
<i>of men</i> or <i>of the people</i> [<i>with his hand</i> and <i>in his
hand</i>]. (M, TA.)

